<title>USA: E-Z-EM to offer AngioDynamics stake.</title>
<headline>E-Z-EM to offer AngioDynamics stake.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBURY, N.Y. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>E-Z-EM Inc said on Friday that its AngioDynamics division will offer up to 20 percent of its equity to the public.</p>
<p>E-Z-EM said it expects the offering to occur in early 1997.</p>
<p>AngioDynamics produces and markets interventional radiology and cardiovascular products.</p>
</text>
